    "Known selectors can go directly to values. Property and quantity scalars remain in their returned unit: an IfcSIUnit name is its base name, while its symbol includes the SI prefix. Combine needed groups and objects in one call for one snapshot. "
    "Applied rejects groups and does not inspect IFC. Current reads pin one CURRENT snapshot; an original Apply from another model cannot be joined to it. "
    "Copy operation_ref from Apply or operation_get; obtain product keys from the original input/report through Data tools, and GUIDs from a confirmed report or current IFC read. "
    "For batch discovery, filter operation_list by tool_name=ifc_products_apply, read a candidate once with operation_get, and use its original input description/rows to verify the business Family; IFC class alone is insufficient. "
    "operation_get's operation.primary_result.summary counts the whole batch; this tool's items contain only the requested selection. "
    "Interpret current.status separately from apply_match.status: an existing object can have no match in the named batch. Omitted source means not_checked. "
    "Null or unreturned data is not evidence of an unassigned relation; interpret each requested group's status and selector scope. "
    "Input/report aliases are returned only if the exact Package is consumable in the current Catalog; not_in_current_catalog retains historical association without an alias. "
    "Failed Apply committed no products; prepared/indeterminate is unresolved and never authorizes re-Apply. "
    "Select at most 32 unique products; each group collection is bounded to 128 entries and the selected facts to 256 KiB. Overflow requires narrower selectors or ifc_query_python, never an implicit partial result. "
    "STEP identities are local to this snapshot, Family interfaces are not IFC ports, and connections do not establish flow or network reachability. "
    "Read cad2bim://contracts/ifc_products_read/usage for complete request examples and result interpretation. "
