APPLY_DESCRIPTION = (
    "Add every product in one complete Parquet payload using one exact published Family, with strict all-or-nothing IFC/report commit. "
    "mode=apply requires family_version_alias, package_alias and payload_name. The Run needs an IFC model with complete geometry basis: project length and plane-angle units, exactly one Model/3D parent context, and a unique Body subcontext with Model/MODEL_VIEW. Read ifc_model_info first and inspect contexts as needed; use ifc_model_configure_geometry_basis only to supply missing configuration. A valid Body alone does not establish complete geometry basis. "
    "Read cad2bim://contracts/ifc_products_apply/input for the six columns, JSON examples, input preparation and report joins. "
    "This synchronous call may take several minutes; there is no Job polling. Normal rejection commits zero products and returns its original diagnostic report when available. "
    "A timeout, disconnect, unavailable report or retryable=false does not prove failure or zero commit. If you have the original operation_ref, read it directly with operation_get mode=operation_reference; only when that reference was lost use operation_list mode=ifc_products_recovery, tool_name=ifc_products_apply to find it before reading. "
    "Use mode=recover with only operation_ref when the original action needs reconciliation; it retains the original identity, inputs, deadline and selected candidate. "
    "A new apply call, even with identical fields, is a new action and can duplicate products. Recovering a persisted failed action returns that failure without rerunning it. "
    "IFC_COMMITTED_READBACK_FAILED means the original commit exists but exact readback is unavailable; never add again to repair it. "
    "On success, operation.primary_result.committed_revision gives revision_no and exact persisted size_bytes for this original operation_ref, not necessarily the latest CURRENT; use these facts without another IFC query. "
    "Start with the returned summary, then use Data aggregates or bounded anomaly rows from products/components/interfaces/checks in operation.primary_result.report_package. Reuse the standard report schema and query template once known; inspect schema again only when unknown or changed. operation_get retains the original Family and input references. "
    "Combine necessary whole-model checks after dependent writes; query earlier only for an actual dependency or anomaly. "
    "Input conditions define the interface's feasible domain. Geometry supplies numerical interfaces, "
    "Family transforms them into solved world frames, and the backend independently evaluates declared constraints. "
    "interface_constraints_evaluated_product_count counts evaluated product rows, including FAIL. "
    "Construction and commit create only the requested product/component Body and Placement. "
    "For installation, associate and read affected CURRENT objects, compare their required relationships, "
    "coordinate pending inputs or Edit saved objects as needed, then verify the affected saved result."
)

